<title>MALAYSIA: Cahya Mata, Denko suspended.</title>
<headline>Cahya Mata, Denko suspended.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The shares of Cahya Mata Sarawak Bhd and Denko Industrial Bhd were suspended on Tuesday at the companies' requests, an official at the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>Officials at Cahya Mata, an infrastructure construction firm, were not available for comment. Its stock closed at 20.00 ringgit on November 8.</p>
<p>A call to Denko was referred to its merchant banker, whose officials were not available for comment.</p>
<p>Denko's businesses include PVC products, metal stamping and packaging materials. Its stock closed at 13 ringgit on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
